00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:41,850
那你为什么从不自己开车
Then why don't you ever drive yourself?

357
00:16:41,970 --> 00:16:43,940
老实说  我考试也是低分通过
Honestly, I barely passed my test.

358
00:16:43,940 --> 00:16:45,610
而我唯一一次独自开车上路
And the one time I drove on my own,

359
00:16:45,610 --> 00:16:49,480
调了个头  开始晕车  吐了满身  最后走回家
I made a U-turn, got dizzy, threw up and walked home.

360
00:16:51,770 --> 00:16:53,410
你真的想开车吗
You really want to drive?

361
00:16:53,800 --> 00:16:55,440
感觉是个很好的时机啊
It seems like the perfect time.

362
00:16:55,440 --> 00:16:58,190
大路笔直  没有车来车往
The roads are straight, there's no one around,

363
00:16:58,190 --> 00:17:01,810
你看起来也不太在乎自己的死活
and you don't seem to care if you live or die.

364
00:17:02,620 --> 00:17:05,410
活着  谢尔顿  我绝对想活着
Live, Sheldon. I want to live.

365
00:17:05,410 --> 00:17:06,820
这样事情就有点难度了
That makes things a little trickier,

366
00:17:06,820 --> 00:17:08,730
不过我会尽力而为
but I'll do my best.

367
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:13,460
嗨  佩...
Hi, Pen...

368
00:17:13,460 --> 00:17:16,190
哦  是你啊  莱纳德
Oh, hello, Leonard.

369
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:19,190
你好  妈妈  最近怎么样
Hello, Mother. How are you?

370
00:17:19,190 --> 00:17:21,250
-很好  你呢  -我也不错
- Fine. And you? - I'm great.

371
00:17:21,250 --> 00:17:23,090
好吧  很高兴和你聊天
Well, it's been lovely catching up.

372
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:26,200
等等  等一下  我们需要谈一谈
Wait. Hang on. We need to talk.

373
00:17:26,260 --> 00:17:27,870
我的老天
Oh, brother.

374
00:17:29,470 --> 00:17:32,780
我想知道  你为什么不为我骄傲
I want to know, why aren't you proud of me?

375
00:17:33,660 --> 00:17:34,910
真正的问题难道不该是
Well, isn't the real question,

376
00:17:34,910 --> 00:17:37,190
"你为什么不为你自己骄傲"
"Why aren't you proud of yourself?"

377
00:17:37,190 --> 00:17:41,690
不  那也是一个问题  我常自问
No, that is a question-- and I ask it a lot--

378
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:44,960
不过现在还是先回答我的问题吧
but let's stick with the one I asked you.

379
00:17:45,580 --> 00:17:47,500
你为什么会觉得我不为你自豪呢
But why do you think I'm not proud of you?

380
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:49,760
因为你从来没说过呀
Because you never say it.

381
00:17:50,130 --> 00:17:51,990
可你和佩妮聊了两天
But two days into chatting with Penny,

382
00:17:51,990 --> 00:17:54,210
你对她总是赞不绝口
and you can't stop telling her how great she is.

383
00:17:54,210 --> 00:17:55,440
她的确很不错
She is great.

384
00:17:55,790 --> 00:17:58,630
老实说  在我所有的儿媳和女婿中
Honestly, of all of my children's spouses,

385
00:17:58,630 --> 00:18:01,610
她是我最欣赏的一个
she's the one that I'm most impressed by.

386
00:18:02,420 --> 00:18:03,320
真的吗
Seriously?

387
00:18:03,320 --> 00:18:04,180
真的
Yes.

388
00:18:04,190 --> 00:18:06,430
她自信满满  体贴入微
She's confident, she's thoughtful,

389
00:18:06,430 --> 00:18:08,710
而且从来没有抱怨过你半句
and she never complained about you once.

390
00:18:08,840 --> 00:18:12,070
我知道这需要多强大的心里素质
I know what kind of strength that takes.

391
00:18:13,220 --> 00:18:15,620
所以佩妮是你的最爱吗
So, Penny's your favorite?

392
00:18:15,990 --> 00:18:17,590
我想她是的
I suppose she is.

393
00:18:17,930 --> 00:18:21,950
你娶了个好姑娘  莱纳德  对此我为你骄傲
You married well, Leonard, and for that I am proud of you.

394
00:18:25,170 --> 00:18:27,150
我...  我不知道...  该说什么了
I don't... I don't... I don't know what to say.

395
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:32,300
我也为你努力克制不哭而骄傲
I'm also proud of how hard you're trying not to cry.

396
00:18:33,490 --> 00:18:34,300
谢谢
Thank you.

397
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:36,430
你想结束视频了吗
Would you like to hang up now?

398
00:18:36,430 --> 00:18:37,710
好  眼泪要决堤了
Yeah, here it comes.

399
00:18:46,040 --> 00:18:47,640
你的双手在10点和2点方向
Your hands are at 10:00 and 2:00.

400
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:50,510
很好  稳稳地踩住油门
Good. Steady on the gas.

401
00:18:50,830 --> 00:18:52,400
不错
Okay.

402
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:56,240
现在你可以慢慢换车道了
Now you're gonna want to slowly switch lanes.

403
00:18:56,250 --> 00:18:57,090
为什么呀
Why?

404
00:18:57,290 --> 00:18:58,950
因为现在路上只有两条车道
Because there are only two,

405
00:18:58,950 --> 00:19:01,330
而你不在任何一条上
and you're not in either of them.

406
00:19:05,950 --> 00:19:07,710
做得好  完美
Attaboy. Well done!

407
00:19:07,780 --> 00:19:08,770
谢谢
Thank you.

408
00:19:09,020 --> 00:19:11,440
上次开车时我还吓得半死
The last time I drove, I was terrified,

409
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,930
今天开车可真有趣
but this is fun.

410
00:19:13,490 --> 00:19:14,700
你开得很不错
You're doing great.

411
00:19:15,020 --> 00:19:16,350
你也是一个好老师
You're a good teacher.

412
00:19:19,650 --> 00:19:22,500
有你这样的爸爸  你儿子一定很幸运
Your son is going to be lucky to have you as a father.

413
00:19:24,750 --> 00:19:25,550
谢谢你
Thanks.

414
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:31,230
你觉得我可以试着再开快一点吗
Do you think I could try going a little faster?

415
00:19:32,420 --> 00:19:33,790
想做就去做吧  小冠军
Go for it, champ.

416
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:34,670
疼呀
Ow.

417
00:19:36,630 --> 00:19:37,300
抱歉
Sorry.

418
00:19:37,300 --> 00:19:39,160
轻轻踩一下油门  然后...
Just ease on the gas, and...

419
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:41,130
踩多了  踩多了
Oh, too much! Too much!

420
00:19:41,130 --> 00:19:43,640
我之前在怕什么  这真是太刺激了
Why was I scared of this? This is exhilarating!

421
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,030
刺激个大头鬼  慢下来
No, it's not! Slow down!

422
00:19:45,030 --> 00:19:46,950
别对我指手画脚的  你又不是我爸爸
Don't tell me what to do! You're not my father!

423
00:19:57,700 --> 00:19:59,200
你知道你开得有多快吗
Do you know how fast you were going?

424
00:19:59,240 --> 00:20:01,420
时速180公里
112.

425
00:20:03,550 --> 00:20:04,880
把驾照给我
Let me see your license.

426
00:20:06,950 --> 00:20:08,510
-听着  我的计划是...  -闭嘴
- Okay, here's the plan. -No.

427
00:20:10,820 --> 00:20:11,620
好吧
Fine.

428
00:20:12,670 --> 00:20:13,620
给你
There you go.

429
00:20:16,220 --> 00:20:18,090
算了  这驾照你留着吧
You know what, you can just keep it.

